    <string name="settings_stamina">Stamina mode</string>
    <string name="settings_stamina_hint">For emergencies, when the battery has to last as long as possible. The map runs at %1$d frames per second, and the GPS updates every %2$s with the map open, every %3$s while following a route and every %4$s while recording. The compass, relief and contour lines are turned off, only downloaded maps are shown, and screens go black. It replaces battery saver.</string>
